section.animate-in.space-y-4
	a.nav-link.text-sm.inline-flex.items-center.gap-1(href="/examples") ← examples
	h1.text-5xl.font-bold.tracking-tight.leading-none
		GradientText Norns
	p.text-lg.max-w-prose.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted")
		| Apps using Norns conventions — Pug + Civet in
		code .n
		| files, with feature folders factored into
		code $lib
		| .

section.animate-in-delayed.pt-12
	.grid.gap-3(class="sm:grid-cols-2")
		Card(href="/examples/norns/tic-tac-toe")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Tic Tac Toe
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") .n
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") components, props, Svelte stores, derived state, AI heuristic
		Card(href="/examples/norns/notes")
			.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-3.mb-2
				h2.font-semibold.text-lg Notes
				span.text-xs.font-mono.shrink-0.mt-1(class="text-fg-subtle") .n
			p.text-sm.leading-relaxed(class="text-fg-muted") SQLite + form actions, dynamic routes, +error.n, SSR load, valibot validation, DI container
